stripes, no Adidas\n[02:09.10]Percocet, codeine, you know how I bleed, ayy\n[02:12.70]Rollin' off a bean I'm a fuckin' fiend, ayy\n[02:16.30]I'm still in my feels I'm still in my feels, ayy\n[02:20.02]I see everything, I see everything\n[Verse 2: DMG Mthang]\n[02:23.04]Yeah, yesterday I was just up in my feels, now I just pour up the lean\n[02:27.44]Drippin' designer jeans, B's, VLONE and B's on the sleeve\n[02:31.14]I might just pop me a Tesla pill\n[02:32.88]But I just fuck with Supreme\n[02:34.44]Finesse the plug right out his packs\n[02:36.44]No, you can't get that shit back, ayy, ayy\n[02:39.84]These bitches, they fuckin' for free\n[02:41.88]I don't do nothin' for free, even my freestyles ain't free\n[02:45.36]Me and Juice up on a track, that mean it's racks on racks\n[02:48.52]Feel like yesterday, we was just broke\n[02:50.74]Now we just dreamin' on stacks\n[02:52.16]Had a little bitch finesse on me\n[02:53.92]You wasn't there when I poured up a three\n[02:55.72]Dropped out of school, like I had something to prove\n[02:57.50]Road runnin', when I cooked up with Juice\n[02:59.32]We official, and I'm telling the truth\n[03:01.06]Bad bitches, and they feeling the crew\n[03:02.82]Doing anything, just for the crew\n[03:04.52]Getting wild, and them bitches get dirty\n[03:06.42]Last year, nobody had heard of me\n[03:08.18]Had to dip, and that bitch had heard me\n[03:09.96]Fucked a bitch now I'm charged like a battery\n[03:12.28]Yeah, uh, I ain't ever had this feelin' here before\n[03:18.06]I'm off a Perc and some lean, I need some more\n[03:21.60]Yeah, some more\n[03:24.66]Gang\n[03:26.80]Uh, yeah you knew I was gonna throw some shit like this though\n[03:31.34]On slime\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[03:32.84]I'm in Hell, lie in Hell, that shit normal to me, huh\n[03:38.26]Ain't no fairy tale, demons tormenting me, huh\n[03:42.24]Drugs help me sleep, I need strong, fuck that weak shit\n[03:49.38]Percocet, codeine, you know how I bleed, ayy\n[03:52.98]Rollin' off a bean I'm a